.com&oh=00_Af1J2wRohybpPf2hvG839pGiRqN8RgPofPSJLouXiT9pCw&oe=69F0C31D"}, {"file_name": "da334f27c2df9e34b98450d101644c07.png", "id": "2407233919785329", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617850_2407233926451995_5757447927095772496_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pAqqpJ_SKWkQ7kNvwGEtdvc&_nc_oc=AdokLGMisqvR52FogibouNb7qkJ_iQULdE-B7enVZXcikRNuExWDBf5wo-xbnXkSKus&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0yLrxqjiJiQMwMI7FiMYNjq-5Ds9z5jGk0wxEVwYVBJg&oe=69F0A797"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "7.png", "id": "969937808726384", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618499_969937815393050_9089291119168794541_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6hHEGeQg2wQQ7kNvwGGXcxe&_nc_oc=AdoNcoXGuXhv44_9sTuZAPW18207Uolod8nqJgzcA3SScBkGqA4Kj94DCVUwz_vxKSw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1yQTkV3cjGphzLQ9Vnzt7J9FJbqINYUslB7XvINX7lXw&oe=69F0BACF"}, "display_name": "Kanvaz", "keywords": ["coloring", "relaxing", "mindfulness", "painting", "cozy"], "long_description": "Kanvaz is a easy, guided, and relaxing paint-by-number experience designed for mindfulness and casual play.\n\nSimply choose a template, follow highlighted zones, stay in the flow and watch your painting come to life - no skill required.\n\n---\n\nKEY FEATURES\n\nAuto-correction system: align your strokes precisely within the zones - filling fast, effortless and impossible to mess up\n{2485077265240201}\n\nRelaxing environments: 5 different moods, designed for calm and focus\n{988961566892343}\n\n36 hand-crafted paint-by-number templates, in various topics\n{27040670372197709}\n\n\n", "short_description": "A guided, easy and relaxing paint-by-number experience where anyone can create beautiful art effortlessly. Choose a template, follow highlighted zones, and watch your painting come to life - no skill required."}]}, "developer_name": "Kanvaz Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_u